flowchart TD
    %% commands: workbench.binding.authorize, session.open, credential.save
    start([Open target]) --> integrity{Standard integrity}
    integrity -->|No| refused([Workbench disabled before file creation])
    integrity -->|Yes| authorize[[Service authorize current target]]
    authorize --> active{Owner and revision valid}
    active -->|No| denied([Reject without secret or data])
    active -->|Yes| credential{User credential available}
    credential -->|No| prompt[Explicit user credential entry]
    prompt --> protect[[CurrentUser DPAPI before persistence]]
    protect --> opened[[Open certified driver]]
    credential -->|Yes| opened
    opened --> valid{TLS and target identity match}
    valid -->|No| closed([Close and report mismatch])
    valid -->|Yes| session[Bind owner window target generation]
    session --> ready([Read-only session ready])
